            <ArticleTitle>Pathophysiology of headache.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>109-14</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Clinical features of different headache syndromes have been described in great detail; however, its pathophysiology remains poorly understood. We review the latest findings in both human imaging studies and experimental animals to explain the possible mechanisms involved in the genesis of headache syndromes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
